      "id": "seq-request",
      "title": "Request a ride, message by message",
      "mermaid": "sequenceDiagram\n  participant ra as Rider App\n  participant tr as Trips\n  participant pay as Payments\n  participant ds as Dispatch\n  participant da as Driver App\n  ra->>+tr: POST /trips\n  tr->>+pay: HoldFare\n  pay-->>-tr: held\n  tr->>+ds: FindDriver\n  loop until a driver accepts\n    ds->>da: Ride offer, 15 s\n    alt accepts\n      da-->>ds: Accept\n    else declines or times out\n      da-->>ds: Decline\n      Note over ds: offer the next nearest driver\n    end\n  end\n  ds-->>-tr: matched\n  tr-->>-ra: 201 Driver on the way",
